Package: fastllqr
Type: Package
Title: Fast Screened Local Linear Quantile Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Erkang", "Zhu", email = "zek24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tianying", "Wang", role = "aut"),
    person("Weichi", "Wu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Fortran-backed exact screened warm-start solvers for
    one-dimensional local linear quantile regression and time-varying
    coefficient quantile regression. Reduced problems are verified against
    omitted observations, with an internal full-active recovery when a
    screened problem cannot be certified.
URL: https://github.com/zekkr/fastllqr
BugReports: https://github.com/zekkr/fastllqr/issues
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: KernSmooth
Suggests:
    quantreg,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
